# Keeps working files out of the deployed site.
#
# Everything in the project folder is published unless it is listed
# here. A static host serves an unknown extension as plain text, so
# index.html.backup-3d would be readable at
#   https://www.theporwals.com/index.html.backup-3d
#
# That matters beyond untidiness: an old backup freezes a past version
# of the page permanently. Switch the FormSubmit endpoint to the hashed
# one and the cleartext-email version stays published in the backup.

# Patch backups
*.backup
*.backup-*
*.bak
*.orig

# Originals kept by the image optimiser
Porwal-Images-original/

# Build and patch tooling — no reason for these to be on the web
*.py
*.sh
*.md
!README.md

# Apps Script source. Belongs in Google, not in the site.
*.gs

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
